    "text": "Michigan\nCampground Thief in Michigan Sentenced to Jail Time\nBy Tommy Carroll,\n5 hours agoMichigan's honor-based campground system was targeted by a thief who’s now facing jail and restitution. Many campgrounds have attendants to collect money from campers staying at their site. Many campgrounds in Michigan operate on an honor system, using pay pipes or pay boxes where campers can submit payment for their campsite.\n1",
